+2026-10-03  Mark Vis  <118430440+mark-vis@users.noreply.github.com>
+
+	* ltfloat.dtx:
+	Add the hooks float/begin and float/end (executed inside the
+	float box by \@xfloat, \@xdblfloat and \@endfloatbox)
+
+	* lttagging.dtx:
+	Add \DeclareTaggingFloatType; the list of float types for tagging
+	moves here from latex-lab-float
+
+	* ltfloat.dtx:
+	Add \caption* and the sockets caption/step and caption/listentry
+
+	* lttagging.dtx:
+	Add tagging sockets subfloat/begin and subfloat/end;
+	\DeclareTaggingFloatType also declares float/<type>/sub.
+	Document that caption/label/begin and caption/label/end can be used
+	inside the caption paragraph
+
+	* classes.dtx:
+	No label separator in \@makecaption if the label is empty
+
 2026-10-01 Joseph Wright  <Joseph.Wright@latex-project.org>
 
 	* ltfloats.dtx:
