diff --git a/required/latex-lab/changes.txt b/required/latex-lab/changes.txt
index d0152f5b9..f71612e2b 100644
--- a/required/latex-lab/changes.txt
+++ b/required/latex-lab/changes.txt
@@ -1,3 +1,30 @@
+2026-10-03  Mark Vis  <118430440+mark-vis@users.noreply.github.com>
+
+	* latex-lab-float.dtx:
+	Execute the kernel hook float/begin in \@xfloat
+	Use \DeclareTaggingFloatType in the key float/new; captions in floats
+	of undeclared types use float/generic/caption and float/generic/label
+
+	* latex-lab-namespace.dtx:
+	Add the names float/generic/caption and float/generic/label
+
+	* latex-lab-float.dtx:
+	Use the kernel socket caption/step instead of redefining \caption,
+	support \caption*, plugs for the sockets subfloat/begin and subfloat/end
+
+	* latex-lab-namespace.dtx:
+	Structure names float/<type>/sub for sub-floats
+
+	* latex-lab-float.dtx:
+	Document the contract of the caption/label socket, add socket
+	caption/separator and plugs label-only and colon, allow the label
+	tagging sockets inside a paragraph, document the label
+	latex-lab-testphase-float of the begindocument redefinition of
+	\@makecaption (classes remove it by this label)
+
+	* latex-lab-listings.dtx:
+	Void the socket caption/separator for titles
+
 2026-10-02  Frank Mittelbach  <Frank.Mittelbach@latex-project.org>
 
 	* latex-lab-block.dtx (subsubsection{The \insttype{thmstyle} instances they use}):
